# Trade Agreement Review of Wheat Gluten Imports

This scope determines if consultation is required based on the comparison of current versus average market share of EC-origin wheat gluten imports.

```catala
declaration scope TradeAgreementReview:
  input current_market_share_date content date
  input average_market_share_date content date
  output consultation_needed content boolean
```

If the market share of EC-origin wheat gluten imports increases compared to the average 1990-92 market share, consultation is required.

```catala
scope TradeAgreementReview:
  date round down
  definition consultation_needed equals current_market_share_date > average_market_share_date
```